                                "sense_id": "399c7504-e086-3f21-a564-7418611a06f3",
                                "text": "The mortall steele stayed not till it was seene / To gore her side; yet was the wound not deepe, / But lightly rased her soft silken skin, / That drops of purple blood thereout did weepe, / Which did her lilly smock with staines of vermeil steep."
                            }
